{"articleNo":"2394","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2394&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009-2학기 대학원(산업및교육) 성적열람 및 정정 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.12.29","hit":"13763","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><!--StartFragment--></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"541\" bgcolor=\"#ffff99\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2009-2학기 대학원 성적열람 및 정정기간 안내</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2009-2학기 대학원(산업 및 교육대학원)의 성적열람 및 정정기간을 아래와 같이 안내합니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1. 성적열람 및 정정신청기간 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 가. 열람 및 정정신청기간 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #ff1493; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2009. 12. 29.(화) 09:00 ~ 12. 31.(목) 18:00까지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 나. 확인방법 : [</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 8.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">원스톱서비스 로그인 - 수업 - 수강신청 및 금학기성적내역조회 -금학기성적]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #1e90ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;※ “NO”로 표시된 과목은 성적 미입력 상태입니다</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\">&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #1e90ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">※ “학적부 사진 미제출자 및 지도교수 미배정신청자”는 성적열람이 불가합니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 성적에 이의가 있어 성적정정 신청을 요하는 경우</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 담당교수 직접 방문, 전화, 이메일 등을 통한 정정신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 담당교수와 연결이 되지 않을 경우 학과(전공)사무실 방문 혹은 전화로 정정신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #8b008b; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">다. 정정신청 후에는 성적정정이 되었는지를</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #8b008b; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #8b008b; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">정정기간내에</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #8b008b; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">반드시</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #8b008b; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 확인하여야 함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #ff1493; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 성적열람 및 정정신청 기간 후에는 금학기 성적이 확정되며, 성적확정 후에는 더 이상 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #ff1493; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;성적정정이 되지 않으므로 기간 내 필히 본인의 성적을 확인하여야 함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">5. 성적확정일자 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #4b0082; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2009. 1. 4.(월) 시간미정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14.4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">6. 각 학과(전공) 종합학사행정실 전화번호<br><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tb